GoldenrodCity_GameCorner_Text_CooltrainerM:
	.string "A strong TRAINER raises their\n"
	.string "POKeMON with care and\ldedication.$"

GoldenrodCity_GameCorner_Text_Gentleman:
	.string "Ah, a fellow TRAINER.\n"
	.string "Best of luck on your travels!$"

GoldenrodCity_GameCorner_Text_Hiker:
	.string "The mountains of JOHTO are\n"
	.string "treacherous but rewarding.\pBe sure to bring ROCK SMASH!$"

GoldenrodCity_GameCorner_Text_Pharmacist:
	.string "If your POKeMON are hurt,\n"
	.string "I can prepare medicine.\pThe herbs are bitter, but\n"
	.string "they work wonders!$"

GoldenrodCity_GameCorner_Text_PokefanF:
	.string "I just adore my POKeMON!\n"
	.string "They're like family to me!$"

GoldenrodCity_GameCorner_Text_PokefanM:
	.string "My POKeMON is the cutest!\n"
	.string "Don't you think so too?$"

GoldenrodCity_GameCorner_Text_Woman:
	.string "Be sure to stock up on supplies\n"
	.string "before heading out on your\ljourney!$"


GoldenrodCity_GameCorner_Text_PokefanM2:
	.string "My POKeMON is the cutest!\nDo you not agree?$"

GoldenrodCity_GameCorner_PrizeRoom_Text_PrizeClerkMons:
	.string "Welcome! Let me know if you\nneed anything.$"
